# Copy to `.env` (which git ignores) and fill in for your machine.
#
# Plugins installed on this machine that the tests may drive, as a path list
# written the way PATH is: separated by `;` on Windows and `:` elsewhere. Both
# formats may be mixed; each test takes the ones it can use and skips when there
# are none. List only plugins that load quickly and without dialogs — a sampler
# that scans its library or an authorisation prompt stalls a headless test.
#
# Keep the single quotes: unquoted, a backslash starts an escape and a Windows
# path is read as something else.
#
# AUDIO_GRAPH_TEST_PLUGINS='C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3\Some Effect.vst3;C:\Program Files\Common Files\CLAP\Another.clap'
